  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the given two signs '**- and ×**' :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 5 - 6 × 3 + 16 ÷ 4 = 31\n\n5 × 6 - 3 + **16 ÷ 4**__ = 31\n\n__**5 × 6**__ - 3 + 4 = 31\n\n__**30 + 4**__ - 3 = 31\n\n__**34 - 3**__ = 31\n\n31 = 31 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 11 + 6 × 3 - 8 ÷ 2 = 5\n\n11 + 6 - 3 × **8 ÷ 2**__ = 5\n\n11 + 6 - __**3 × 4**__ = 5\n\n__**11 + 6**__ - 12 = 5\n\n__**17 - 12**__ = 5\n\n5 = 5 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 7 × 8 + 4 ÷ 2 - 6 = 11\n\n7 - 8 + **4 ÷ 2**__ × 6 = 11\n\n7 - 8 + __**2 **____**× 6**__ = 11\n\n__**7 + 12**__ - 8 = 11\n\n__**19 - 8**__ = 11\n\n11 = 11 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 7 × 2 + 27 ÷ 9 - 4 = 18\n\n7 - 2 + **27 ÷ 9**__ × 4 = 18\n\n7 - 2 + __**3 × 4**__ = 18\n\n__**7 + 12**__ - 2 = 18\n\n__**19 - 2**__ = 18\n\n**17 ≠ 18 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
